    "text": "1 days ago Greenup County earned a strong second-place finish after an impressive lower bracket run that included victories over Ironton, Portsmouth West, and Valley. Valley High School finished third after a competitive lower bracket finals match against Greenup. Portsmouth West High School, despite recently launching its esports program, impressed competitors with a fourth-place finish and several close matches throughout the tournament. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
